    {
      "name": "set-passkey",
      "description": "Restate an item's passkey slot through locker.set_passkey: relying-party id, user handle, display name, credential id and algorithm, with the sealed key kept by sending «sealed» back. Storage only — this performs no WebAuthn ceremony, and the phone neither makes a passkey nor reveals its key.",
