    {
      "name": "set-memo",
      "description": "Write or clear an item's memo through locker.set_memo — the member's own plaintext remark, a knowledge.annotation on the item: searchable in the vault and never sealed, so it is not the place for a secret. An empty note clears it. Refuses a trashed item.",
